    "raw": "When determining the spell’s effect on nonmythic creatures, add your tier to your caster level. Nonlawful creatures that fail their saves against the spell also take a –4 penalty on attack rolls and saving throws, and their spell resistance decreases by 5 for as long as the spell’s other effects last.",
